    "b-10-operator-runbook-ends-the-session-pause-17": {
      "id": "b-10-operator-runbook-ends-the-session-pause-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "   ends the session (pause → pull & rebase → PR intake for anything newly\n   merged → rebuild production baseline → branch QA vs that baseline →\n   checkpoint with regressed symbols forced to needs_rework → readmit rework\n   at repair priority → match-only split plan → verify ship set →\n   auto-reconcile if blocked → replan against the survivors → seed the PR\n   board → "
        },
        {
          "insert": "ship",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " save point). Every step shows live in the activity card.\n   Only exact matches that survive the ship-set verification ship;\n   everything else stays on the local branch. When the survivor loop drops\n   files, the final plan regenerates with "
        },
        {
          "insert": "--ship-status",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", so match slices\n   already exclude them — ship from the plan as written, no manual\n   subtraction."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-operator-runbook-the-gate-is-the-ship-s-18": {
      "id": "b-10-operator-runbook-the-gate-is-the-ship-s-18",
      "type": "list-item",
      "props": {
        "ordered": true
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The gate is the "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Ship set",
          "attributes": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " row, not Branch QA. Branch regressions are"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-10-operator-runbook-readmitted-as-rework-aut-19": {
      "id": "b-10-operator-runbook-readmitted-as-rework-aut-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "   readmitted as rework automatically; the pipeline only stops if the match\n   files themselves regress the baseline (run "
        },
